    "text": "Clovis\nLet the Music Battle Begin: $3,000 Up for Grabs at Curry County Fair’s Battle of the Bands\nBy Landon,\n8 hours agoHey Lubbock-area bands, crank up the volume and get ready to rock—the 4th Annual Battle of the Bands is back, and it’s going down Friday, August 15th at the Curry County Fairgrounds in Clovis, New Mexico!. A Major Grand Prize!. This isn’t just a few friends strumming guitars...",
